her ingredients for an antidote and free captured villagers, using the Smurfizer, an invention by Handy Smurf. You play as four Smurfs, Smurfette, Hefty, Brainy and Chef, across five worlds, healing sick plants while heading toward Gargamel's hovel.\n\nThis action-adventure offers split-screen co-op as well as solo play, so a friend or family member can join on the same screen. The cartoon setting, familiar cast and plant-healing mission make it a natural fit for families and younger fans of the Smurfs. Full controller support is included."}}